id: absorption-awakening
name: Absorption Awakening
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 99
# Not a Combat Condition: the Absorb Maneuver's stack - the Absorbed Characters named on the character (flags absorbedWith).
# Awakenings are not in this system; what the Awakening does is the table's.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Absorb: a stack of the Absorption Awakening for each Character Absorbed.
text: >
  You gain a stack of the Absorption Awakening as a Level 2 Temporary Awakening with that Character as the Absorbed Character.

---

# What reads it: Natural Dragon (Personified Dragon Ball's Option, Draconic Physique's and Disguised Shadow's Choice) - their scripts.
